# Binary assets must never have line endings rewritten.
#
# Without this, git sniffed one of the report PDFs as text (it happens to have
# no NUL byte early in the file) and core.autocrlf would have rewritten its
# line endings on checkout — producing a PDF that will not open. Marking the
# types explicitly is the only reliable fix.
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
